# Flashcards Feature

## Separation of concerns

- Parsing logic must remain pure.
- UI components never perform parsing.
- Business rules belong in the feature domain.
- Memorization logic stays isolated from presentation.
- Components remain presentation-focused.
- Never mix Firebase code directly into UI components.

## Feature structure

- Session state belongs in feature state management.
- Reusable feature hooks belong in `hooks`.
- Utilities belong in `utils`.
- Domain types belong in `types`.
